# Copy to secrets.env (chmod 600, keep it out of git) and mount it as the
# `dsh_env` secret; the entrypoint imports /run/secrets/dsh.env with `set -a`.
# Keys never enter the image, the cordis layers, the compose file, or the
# container's inspectable environment.
#
# KEY=VALUE, one per line. No `export`.

# Shared token for the login gate (dsh-auth-gate, token mode by default).
# Leave it unset to have the first start generate one inside the volume and
# print it once. For username/password login instead, override the plugin's
# config in the overlay (see docs/configuration.md).
# DSH_AUTH_TOKEN=

# LLM provider keys: the name must match apiKeyEnv in your
# overlay/10-providers.patch.yml.
# MY_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
